firefly-debug:
Minimal repro first; root-cause hypotheses registered with one experiment each;
one variable changes per round, repro runs before and after; a fix must explain why it
treats the cause, not the symptom. A regression test locks the bug.

firefly-perf:
No optimization without a repeatable benchmark; bottleneck claims cite profile
evidence; every change wagers a predicted gain and re-measures, rolling back on miss;
complexity-for-speed trades are declared in an ADR.
